<title>FRANCE: Havas Advertising net 190.8 mln Ffr.</title>
<headline>Havas Advertising net 190.8 mln Ffr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable after exceptionals  190.8  vs	   151.5</p>
<p>    Net attributable pre-exceptionals    192.2  vs	   170.6</p>
<p>    Net dividend (francs)			 13  vs	   11.80</p>
<p>    Gross dividend (francs)		  19.50  vs	   17.70</p>
<p>    Net attributable after goodwill	104.8  up 53 percent</p>
<p>    Net debt				     896.0  vs	   895.0</p>
<p>    Billings				  26,559.0  vs	 9,112.0</p>
<p>    Gross income			     4,000.0  vs	 4,365.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Havas Advertising gave its results in a statement. It said the outlook for 1997 was good, with the world market showing eight percent growth. It will benefit from the weight and growth in the United States, where it is well established. South America and Asia are showing growth of between 20-25 percent a year. A recovery in France and Europe, where the market is expected to grow three to four percent, will also help. Productivity gains through restructuring efforts of the last few years and business development should result in greater profitability for the group in 1997.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
